{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不必澄清  (No Need to Clarify)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After someone posts Chun Yuqiao's graduate-school photo online, Yuqiao leaves the office early and intern Bu Xiaogu hurries outside after him. Listen to the Mandarin conversation first, and do not worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我提前下班了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也提前下班了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "网上有很多诽谤你的话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "世上有两样东西是管不住的，其中之一就是别人的嘴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你为什么不出面澄清呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大众关心的是艺人之间的绯闻，没有人会在乎制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不理它，自然就过去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就是你想要的吗？想要负面新闻赶快过去？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果这不是真相，你为什么不澄清呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "决赛直播之前，不要节外生枝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没什么好解释的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那就是说，辛惠美说的是真的了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我提前下班了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I got off work early.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也提前下班了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I got off work early too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "网上有很多诽谤你的话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There are many slanderous remarks about you online.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "世上有两样东西是管不住的，其中之一就是别人的嘴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two things in this world cannot be controlled, and one is other people's mouths.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你为什么不出面澄清呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then why do you not step forward to clarify things?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大众关心的是艺人之间的绯闻，没有人会在乎制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The public cares about gossip between stars; nobody cares about a producer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不理它，自然就过去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ignore it, and it will naturally blow over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就是你想要的吗？想要负面新闻赶快过去？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that what you want, just hoping negative news blows over quickly?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果这不是真相，你为什么不澄清呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If this is not the truth, why will you not clear it up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "决赛直播之前，不要节外生枝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before the live finale broadcast, do not cause extra complications.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没什么好解释的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is nothing worth explaining.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那就是说，辛惠美说的是真的了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does that mean what Xin Huimei said is true?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我提前下班了。",
      "gap": 0.5
